<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This is a macro to preform a 180 degree turn instant formless in the game LOCKED on Roblox, the best settings is 700 DPI, 1920 x 1080 resolution and 0.413 Roblox sensitivityAto get an almost perfect formless each time, shooting wherever you aim each time.</Description>
    <Comment>This is a macro to preform a 180 degree turn instant formless in the game LOCKED on Roblox, the best settings is 700 DPI, 1920 x 1080 resolution and 0.413 Roblox sensitivityAto get an almost perfect formless each time, shooting wherever you aim each time.</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveR -870 0
Button4down 1
Delay 64
Button4Up 1
Delay 64
Button4down 1
Delay 64
Button4Up 1
Delay 64
MoveR 0 -360
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 15 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 15 ms
RightUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>